		(uuid "006c778f-6c2a-44bc-b645-98744faaffe5")
	)
	(text "The only output that goes elsewhere is H78,\nwhich gets latched by H82(a), coming directly\nback here as /Pulse_1_Counter_Preload; all\nself-contained.  It does not appear to provide\nany other external signals, so I don't think\nit actually does anything.  It seems like an\nabandoned envelope counter that was left in.\n\nIt latches the 4-bit pulse volume, then counts\nup at a rate of 240 Hz.  Nothing stops it from\ncounting or rolling over from $F back to $0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 337.058 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "670bf396-4bff-47df-8f19-7554f9e72956")
	)
